   "widgets_values": [
    "# Draw your own level\n\nEdit the text in **Level From Text**: `#` ground, `=` platform, `^` spikes, `o` coin, `*` gem, `?` bonus block, `S` spring, `M` moving platform, `a`-`h` enemies, `P` start, `G` goal.\n\nIt becomes level 1, followed by two generated levels with a boss."
   ],
